  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The required diagram is:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7ba84c44-95ca-4a9b-aefa-24a3f98eb32c.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 226px;\" /></p><p>The shaded region is symmetric about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis.</p><p>Required area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
